                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">HTTP / HTTPS</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">Give a local web app a public HTTPS URL, with automatic SSL and custom domains.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>Web apps</li><li>APIs</li><li>Webhooks</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/documents/tcp" data-card="tunnel" class="tt-card">
                        <span class="tt-card__icon"><svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/></svg></span>
                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">TCP</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">Reach any TCP service from anywhere, with no port forwarding or static IP.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>SSH</li><li>RDP</li><li>Databases</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/documents/tls" data-card="tunnel" class="tt-card">
                        <span class="tt-card__icon"><svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg></span>
                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">TLS</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">Encrypted TCP with TLS passthrough, so your service keeps its own certificate.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>Own certificate</li><li>MQTTS</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/documents/udp" data-card="tunnel" class="tt-card">
                        <span class="tt-card__icon"><svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg></span>
                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">UDP</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">Forward UDP traffic to a local port for real-time, latency-sensitive services.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>Game servers</li><li>VoIP</li><li>DNS</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/documents/udp-tcp" data-card="tunnel" class="tt-card">
                        <span class="tt-card__icon"><svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="17 8 21 12 17 16"/><polyline points="7 8 3 12 7 16"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/></svg></span>
                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">UDP / TCP Mixed</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">One tunnel for services that need both TCP and UDP on the same port.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>Game servers</li><li>Voice servers</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/documents/file-server" data-card="tunnel" class="tt-card">
                        <span class="tt-card__icon"><svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg></span>
                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">File Server</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">Share a local folder as a link anyone can open in a browser. No web server needed.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>Folder sharing</li><li>Downloads</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>

                    <a href="/documents/proxy-server" data-card="tunnel" class="tt-card">
                        <span class="tt-card__icon"><svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span>
                        <h3 class="tt-card__title">Proxy Server</h3>
                        <p class="tt-card__desc">Turn your computer or Android phone into an HTTP or SOCKS5 proxy endpoint.</p>
                        <ul class="tt-card__tags" aria-label="Best for"><li>Mobile proxy</li><li>IP rotation</li></ul>
                        <span class="tt-card__more">Read the guide <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <button id="tunnelNext" type="button" class="tt-nav tt-nav--next" aria-label="Next">
                <svg class="home-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="home-deferred home-how relative md:py-24 py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 pb-8 text-center">
            <h2 class="mb-6 md:text-3xl text-2xl md:leading-normal leading-normal font-semibold">How It Works</h2>
                <p>Localtonet creates an outbound, encrypted Tunnel from your device to the Localtonet Servers.</p>
                <p>We give you a secure public URL that forwards traffic back down that tunnel to your local service.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-it-works-diagram">
            <div class="hiw">
                <div class="hiw-node hiw-node--client">
                    <span class="hiw-node__icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
                        <span class="hiw-node__step">1</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="hiw-node__text">
                        <span class="hiw-node__title">Clients</span>
                        <span class="hiw-node__sub">Internet</span>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-link hiw-link--web">
                    <span class="hiw-link__label">Web Requests</span>
                    <span class="hiw-link__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hiw-link__pulse"></span></span>
                    <code class="hiw-chip" translate="no">myapp.localto.net</code>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-node hiw-node--server">
                    <span class="hiw-node__icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect x="2" y="14" width="20" height="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="6.01" y2="6"/><line x1="6" y1="18" x2="6.01" y2="18"/></svg>
                        <span class="hiw-node__step">2</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="hiw-node__text">
                        <span class="hiw-node__title"><span translate="no">Localtonet</span> Servers</span>
                        <span class="hiw-node__sub">Cloud Infrastructure</span>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-link hiw-link--tunnel">
                    <span class="hiw-link__label">
                        <svg class="hiw-link__lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
                        <span>Encrypted Tunnel</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="hiw-link__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hiw-link__pulse"></span></span>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-zone">
                    <span class="hiw-zone__label">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg>
                        <span>Your Device</span>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-node hiw-node--app">
                    <span class="hiw-node__icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
                        <span class="hiw-node__step">3</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="hiw-node__text">
                        <span class="hiw-node__title">Localtonet App</span>
                        <span class="hiw-node__sub hiw-node__sub--live"><span class="hiw-node__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Tunnel active ✓</span>
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-link hiw-link--local">
                    <span class="hiw-link__track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="hiw-link__pulse"></span></span>
                </div>

                <div class="hiw-node hiw-node--service">
                    <span class="hiw-node__icon">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
                        <span class="hiw-node__step">4</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="hiw-node__text">
                        <span class="hiw-node__title">Local Service</span>
                        <code class="hiw-chip" translate="no">localhost:3000</code>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="features" class="home-deferred relative md:py-24 py-16">
    <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10">
        <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-48 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50/60 to-transparent dark:from-indigo-500/5"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 text-center mb-12">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 text-sm font-medium mb-4 mx-auto">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-cubes-stacked mr-2"></i> Powerful Features
            </span>
            <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Everything You Need</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">Comprehensive tunneling solution with enterprise-grade features for developers, teams, and businesses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-2 grid-cols-1 gap-6">
            <!-- Any Protocol -->
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="feature-badge feature-badge-protocol">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> Multi-Protocol
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2"><a href="/blog/multi-protocol-secure-tunneling-localtonet" class="feature-card-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Any Protocol</a></h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Tunnel any TCP or UDP based protocol through our secure network.</p>
                    <div class="feature-list">
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> HTTP/HTTPS &amp; WebSocket</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> TCP, UDP &amp; TLS</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> SSH, RDP &amp; Database</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Game servers &amp; VoIP</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Runs Everywhere -->
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-laptop-code"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="feature-badge feature-badge-platform">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip"></i> Cross-Platform
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2"><a href="/blog/localtonet-runs-everywhere" class="feature-card-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Runs Everywhere</a></h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Single portable binary with zero dependencies across all platforms.</p>
                    <div class="feature-list">
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Windows, macOS, Linux</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Android mobile app</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Docker &amp; containers</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> ARM &amp; x86 support</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- IP Whitelisting -->
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="feature-badge feature-badge-security">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Access Control
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2"><a href="/blog" class="feature-card-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IP Whitelisting</a></h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Granular access control to protect your tunnels from unauthorized access.</p>
                    <div class="feature-list">
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Allow/block IP ranges</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Country-based filtering</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Real-time IP logging</div>
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Automatic threat blocking</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Instant Domains -->
            <article class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon-wrapper">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-globe"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <span class="feature-badge feature-badge-domain">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-link"></i> Custom URLs
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2"><a href="/blog/how-to-add-custom-domain-on-localtonet" class="feature-card-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instant Domains</a></h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Get public URLs instantly or bring your own custom domain.</p>
                    <div class="feature-list">
                        <div class="feature-list-item"><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Free subdomains</div>
