<section id="proxy-operators" class="home-deferred" aria-labelledby="proxy-operators-title">
    <div class="po-fade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="po-glow po-glow--indigo" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="po-glow po-glow--fuchsia" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container po-container">
        <div class="po-head">
            <p class="po-badge"><span class="po-badge__icon"><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.6-6.4L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/></svg></span>For proxy operators</p>
            <h2 id="proxy-operators-title" class="po-title">Run proxies on <span class="po-accent">your own devices</span></h2>
            <p class="po-lead">Phones, USB modems and any device that runs Localtonet become proxies with a public endpoint. You keep the hardware, the IPs and the customers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="po-grid">
                <a class="po-card po-card--mobile" href="/mobile-proxy">
                    <span class="po-card__top">
                        <span class="po-card__icon"><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="6" y="2" width="12" height="20" rx="2.5"/><path d="M11 18h2"/></svg></span>
                        <span class="po-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="po-ico cmp-flip" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
                    </span>
                    <h3>Mobile proxy</h3>
                    <p>Turn an Android phone into a 4G/5G proxy with its own mobile IP and IP rotation.</p>
                    <ul>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> No root needed for IP rotation</li>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> No port forwarding or VPS</li>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Works behind CGNAT</li>
                    </ul>
                    <span class="po-card__more">Explore <svg class="po-ico cmp-flip" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
                </a>
                <a class="po-card po-card--rotating" href="/rotating-proxy">
                    <span class="po-card__top">
                        <span class="po-card__icon"><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.6-6.4L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/></svg></span>
                        <span class="po-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="po-ico cmp-flip" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
                    </span>
                    <h3>Rotating proxy</h3>
                    <p>One endpoint that rotates over your own devices, with a separate login for each client.</p>
                    <ul>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Rotating HTTP and SOCKS5</li>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> A login for each client</li>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Sticky sessions</li>
                    </ul>
                    <span class="po-card__more">Explore <svg class="po-ico cmp-flip" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
                </a>
                <a class="po-card po-card--farm" href="/proxy-farm">
                    <span class="po-card__top">
                        <span class="po-card__icon"><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="18" height="7" rx="2"/><path d="M7 6.5h.01M7 17.5h.01"/></svg></span>
                        <span class="po-card__go" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="po-ico cmp-flip" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
                    </span>
                    <h3>Proxy farm</h3>
                    <p>Manage many phones and USB modems together: health, bulk rotation and restart, SMS.</p>
                    <ul>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Bulk rotate and restart</li>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Phones and USB modems</li>
                            <li><svg class="po-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> SMS and USSD</li>
                    </ul>
                    <span class="po-card__more">Explore <svg class="po-ico cmp-flip" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></span>
                </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="mobile-edge" class="home-deferred relative md:py-24 py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-slate-800">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 text-center pb-10">
